{"type":"standard","title":"John Mannion (American politician)","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">John Mannion (American politician)</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q106089566","titles":{"canonical":"John_Mannion_(American_politician)","normalized":"John Mannion (American politician)","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">John Mannion (American politician)</span></span>"},"pageid":67166204,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4c/John_Mannion%2C_official_portrait_%28119th_Congress%29.jpg/330px-John_Mannion%2C_official_portrait_%28119th_Congress%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":413},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4c/John_Mannion%2C_official_portrait_%28119th_Congress%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":2336,"height":2920},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1372454375","tid":"eb27a3af-a57b-11f1-bf15-e0a08c461b4d","timestamp":"2026-08-31T20:38:27Z","description":"American politician (born 1968)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Mannion_(American_politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Mannion_(American_politician)?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Mannion_(American_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:John_Mannion_(American_politician)"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Mannion_(American_politician)","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/John_Mannion_(American_politician)","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Mannion_(American_politician)?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:John_Mannion_(American_politician)"}},"extract":"John W. Mannion is an American educator and politician who has served as the U.S. representative from New York's 22nd congressional district since 2025. He previously served as a state senator from the 50th district between 2020 and 2024. Before entering politics, Mannion was a high school biology teacher.","extract_html":"<p><b>John W. Mannion</b> is an American educator and politician who has served as the U.S. representative from New York's 22nd congressional district since 2025. He previously served as a state senator from the 50th district between 2020 and 2024. Before entering politics, Mannion was a high school biology teacher.</p>"}